{"id":"eeaa128b028a8273","group":"14","path":"14/14-thm-open-topos-slice.md","title":"Theorem — 开子拓扑斯等价于子终对象切片","display":"Theorem — 开子拓扑斯等价于子终对象切片","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Sheaves in Geometry and Logic (Mac Lane & Moerdijk)","book_abbrev":"14","label":"14-thm-open-topos-slice","aliases":["14-thm-open-topos-slice"],"display":"Theorem — 开子拓扑斯等价于子终对象切片","source_ref":"Reconstructed from IV.7 slice topos and IX.4 p.486 (10), DjVu249 left","source_status":"来源定位沿用附件笔记；本次未重新核验原书文件。","verification_status":"assistant-semantic-review; not-proof-assistant-checked","depends_on":["[[14-df-open-closed-topologies]]","[[14-thm-open-sheaf-exponential]]","[[14-df-lawvere-tierney-sheaf-category]]","[[14-df-slice-category]]","[[14-df-cartesian-closed-category]]","[[14-df-category-equivalence]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Sheaves in Geometry and Logic (Mac Lane &amp; Moerdijk)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"14"},{"key":"label","html":"14-thm-open-topos-slice"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>14-thm-open-topos-slice</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"Theorem — 开子拓扑斯等价于子终对象切片"},{"key":"source_ref","html":"Reconstructed from IV.7 slice topos and IX.4 p.486 (10), DjVu249 left"},{"key":"source_status","html":"来源定位沿用附件笔记；本次未重新核验原书文件。"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"assistant-semantic-review; not-proof-assistant-checked"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"46d4e2094b01f6d4\" href=\"?note=46d4e2094b01f6d4\" title=\"14-df-open-closed-topologies\">14-df-open-closed-topologies</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"9b47287c9839ebc7\" href=\"?note=9b47287c9839ebc7\" title=\"14-thm-open-sheaf-exponential\">14-thm-open-sheaf-exponential</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"389620cd4ca5e1c6\" href=\"?note=389620cd4ca5e1c6\" title=\"14-df-lawvere-tierney-sheaf-category\">14-df-lawvere-tierney-sheaf-category</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"7cd6386b14d5d667\" href=\"?note=7cd6386b14d5d667\" title=\"14-df-slice-category\">14-df-slice-category</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"4bf0b109a78ca196\" href=\"?note=4bf0b109a78ca196\" title=\"14-df-cartesian-closed-category\">14-df-cartesian-closed-category</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"c502117a84587a7c\" href=\"?note=c502117a84587a7c\" title=\"14-df-category-equivalence\">14-df-category-equivalence</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p>采用 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"46d4e2094b01f6d4\" href=\"?note=46d4e2094b01f6d4\" title=\"14-df-open-closed-topologies\">14-df-open-closed-topologies</a> 的数据；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal S=\\mathbf{Sh}_{j_U^{\\mathrm o}}(\\mathcal E)\">\\(\\mathcal S=\\mathbf{Sh}_{j_U^{\\mathrm o}}(\\mathcal E)\\)</span>。切片对象为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"P=(Y,p:Y\\to U)\">\\(P=(Y,p:Y\\to U)\\)</span>，切片箭头为 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"7cd6386b14d5d667\" href=\"?note=7cd6386b14d5d667\" title=\"14-df-slice-category\">14-df-slice-category</a> 的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(P,Q,h)\">\\((P,Q,h)\\)</span>，其中 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"h\">\\(h\\)</span> 是底层箭头。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Lambda_U\">\\(\\Lambda_U\\)</span> 为指数转置，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{ev}_{Y,U}:Y^U\\times U\\to Y\">\\(\\operatorname{ev}_{Y,U}:Y^U\\times U\\to Y\\)</span> 为求值；下式定义 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"h^U\">\\(h^U\\)</span>，其中 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"h:Y\\to Z\">\\(h:Y\\to Z\\)</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"F,G\">\\(F,G\\)</span> 是以下分量给出的候选函子；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"h:X\\to X&#39;\">\\(h:X\\to X&#39;\\)</span> 在第一式中为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal S\">\\(\\mathcal S\\)</span> 的箭头。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"F_0(X):=(X\\times U,\\pi_U),\\qquad F_1(h):=(F_0(X),F_0(X&#39;),h\\times1_U).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[F_0(X):=(X\\times U,\\pi_U),\\qquad F_1(h):=(F_0(X),F_0(X&#39;),h\\times1_U).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"h^U:=\\Lambda_U(h\\circ\\operatorname{ev}_{Y,U}),\\qquad G_0(Y,p):=Y^U,\\qquad G_1(P,Q,h):=h^U.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[h^U:=\\Lambda_U(h\\circ\\operatorname{ev}_{Y,U}),\\qquad G_0(Y,p):=Y^U,\\qquad G_1(P,Q,h):=h^U.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"F:=(F_0,F_1),\\qquad G:=(G_0,G_1),\\qquad \\operatorname{IsFunctor}(F,\\mathcal S,\\mathcal E/U)\\land\\operatorname{IsFunctor}(G,\\mathcal E/U,\\mathcal S).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[F:=(F_0,F_1),\\qquad G:=(G_0,G_1),\\qquad \\operatorname{IsFunctor}(F,\\mathcal S,\\mathcal E/U)\\land\\operatorname{IsFunctor}(G,\\mathcal E/U,\\mathcal S).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{IsEquivalence}(F)\\land\\operatorname{IsEquivalence}(G),\\qquad \\mathcal S\\simeq\\mathcal E/U.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{IsEquivalence}(F)\\land\\operatorname{IsEquivalence}(G),\\qquad \\mathcal S\\simeq\\mathcal E/U.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"U\">\\(U\\)</span> 子终意味着对角 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"U\\to U\\times U\">\\(U\\to U\\times U\\)</span> 为同构，故 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(Y^U)^U\\cong Y^{U\\times U}\\cong Y^U\">\\((Y^U)^U\\cong Y^{U\\times U}\\cong Y^U\\)</span>，并且此比较就是<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-9\" data-note=\"9b47287c9839ebc7\" href=\"?note=9b47287c9839ebc7\" title=\"14-thm-open-sheaf-exponential\">14-thm-open-sheaf-exponential</a>的判据箭头，所以 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"G_0\">\\(G_0\\)</span> 确实落在开层中。对切片对象 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"p:Y\\to U\">\\(p:Y\\to U\\)</span>，求值给出 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"Y^U\\times U\\to Y\">\\(Y^U\\times U\\to Y\\)</span>；其逆为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\langle\\delta_Y,p\\rangle\">\\(\\langle\\delta_Y,p\\rangle\\)</span>，两复合利用子终性和指数求值方程验证为恒等。对开层 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X\">\\(X\\)</span>，自然箭头 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X\\to(X\\times U)^U\">\\(X\\to(X\\times U)^U\\)</span> 是 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\delta_X:X\\to X^U\">\\(\\delta_X:X\\to X^U\\)</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"U^U\\cong1\">\\(U^U\\cong1\\)</span> 的乘积，因此可逆。两组自然同构给出准逆；箭头作用保持复合由积与指数函子性。这里显式记录切片态射的源靶，避免把同一个底层箭头混用于不同切片对象对。原书 IV.7 给切片拓扑斯，IX.4 给开核；此等价是据二者完成的笔记推导。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"14-df-open-closed-topologies","status":"resolved","id":"46d4e2094b01f6d4","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[14-df-open-closed-topologies]]","embed":false},{"target":"14-thm-open-sheaf-exponential","status":"resolved","id":"9b47287c9839ebc7","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[14-thm-open-sheaf-exponential]]","embed":false},{"target":"14-df-lawvere-tierney-sheaf-category","status":"resolved","id":"389620cd4ca5e1c6","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[14-df-lawvere-tierney-sheaf-category]]","embed":false},{"target":"14-df-slice-category","status":"resolved","id":"7cd6386b14d5d667","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[14-df-slice-category]]","embed":false},{"target":"14-df-cartesian-closed-category","status":"resolved","id":"4bf0b109a78ca196","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[14-df-cartesian-closed-category]]","embed":false},{"target":"14-df-category-equivalence","status":"resolved","id":"c502117a84587a7c","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[14-df-category-equivalence]]","embed":false},{"target":"14-df-open-closed-topologies","status":"resolved","id":"46d4e2094b01f6d4","anchor":"ref-7","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"采用 [[14-df-open-closed-topologies]] 的数据；$\\mathcal S=\\mathbf{Sh}_{j_U^{\\mathrm o}}(\\mathcal E)$。切片对象为 $P=(Y,p:Y\\to U)$，切片箭头为 [[14-df-slice-category]] 的 $(P,Q,h)$，其中 $h$ 是底层箭头。$\\Lambda_U$ 为指数转置，$\\operatorname{ev}_{Y,U}:Y^U\\times U\\to Y$ 为求值；下式定义 $h^U$，其中 $h:Y\\to Z$。$F,G$ 是以下分量给出的候选函子；$h:X\\to X'$ 在第一式中为 $\\mathcal S$ 的箭头。","embed":false},{"target":"14-df-slice-category","status":"resolved","id":"7cd6386b14d5d667","anchor":"ref-8","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"采用 [[14-df-open-closed-topologies]] 的数据；$\\mathcal S=\\mathbf{Sh}_{j_U^{\\mathrm o}}(\\mathcal E)$。切片对象为 $P=(Y,p:Y\\to U)$，切片箭头为 [[14-df-slice-category]] 的 $(P,Q,h)$，其中 $h$ 是底层箭头。$\\Lambda_U$ 为指数转置，$\\operatorname{ev}_{Y,U}:Y^U\\times U\\to Y$ 为求值；下式定义 $h^U$，其中 $h:Y\\to Z$。$F,G$ 是以下分量给出的候选函子；$h:X\\to X'$ 在第一式中为 $\\mathcal S$ 的箭头。","embed":false},{"target":"14-thm-open-sheaf-exponential","status":"resolved","id":"9b47287c9839ebc7","anchor":"ref-9","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Remark]","excerpt":"$U$ 子终意味着对角 $U\\to U\\times U$ 为同构，故 $(Y^U)^U\\cong Y^{U\\times U}\\cong Y^U$，并且此比较就是[[14-thm-open-sheaf-exponential]]的判据箭头，所以 $G_0$ 确实落在开层中。对切片对象 $p:Y\\to U$，求值给出 $Y^U\\times U\\to Y$；其逆为 $\\langle\\delta_Y,p\\rangle$，两复合利用子终性和指数求值方程验证为恒等。对开层 $X$，自然箭头 $X\\to(X\\times U)^U$ 是 $\\delta_X:X\\to X^U$ 与 $U^U\\cong1$ 的乘积，因此可逆。两组自然同构给出准逆；箭头作用保持复合由积与指数函子性。这里显式记录切片态射的源靶，避免把同一个底层箭头混用于不同切片对象对。原书 IV.7 给切片拓扑斯，IX.4 给开核；此等价是据二者完成的笔记推导。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathcal S=\\mathbf{Sh}_{j_U^{\\mathrm o}}(\\mathcal E)","display":false},{"tex":"P=(Y,p:Y\\to U)","display":false},{"tex":"(P,Q,h)","display":false},{"tex":"h","display":false},{"tex":"\\Lambda_U","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{ev}_{Y,U}:Y^U\\times U\\to Y","display":false},{"tex":"h^U","display":false},{"tex":"h:Y\\to Z","display":false},{"tex":"F,G","display":false},{"tex":"h:X\\to X'","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal S","display":false},{"tex":"F_0(X):=(X\\times U,\\pi_U),\\qquad F_1(h):=(F_0(X),F_0(X'),h\\times1_U).","display":true},{"tex":"h^U:=\\Lambda_U(h\\circ\\operatorname{ev}_{Y,U}),\\qquad G_0(Y,p):=Y^U,\\qquad G_1(P,Q,h):=h^U.","display":true},{"tex":"F:=(F_0,F_1),\\qquad G:=(G_0,G_1),\\qquad \\operatorname{IsFunctor}(F,\\mathcal S,\\mathcal E/U)\\land\\operatorname{IsFunctor}(G,\\mathcal E/U,\\mathcal S).","display":true},{"tex":"\\operatorname{IsEquivalence}(F)\\land\\operatorname{IsEquivalence}(G),\\qquad \\mathcal S\\simeq\\mathcal E/U.","display":true},{"tex":"U","display":false},{"tex":"U\\to U\\times U","display":false},{"tex":"(Y^U)^U\\cong Y^{U\\times U}\\cong Y^U","display":false},{"tex":"G_0","display":false},{"tex":"p:Y\\to U","display":false},{"tex":"Y^U\\times U\\to Y","display":false},{"tex":"\\langle\\delta_Y,p\\rangle","display":false},{"tex":"X","display":false},{"tex":"X\\to(X\\times U)^U","display":false},{"tex":"\\delta_X:X\\to X^U","display":false},{"tex":"U^U\\cong1","display":false}],"bytes":2504,"backlinks":[{"id":"c53146be63465990","anchor":"ref-190","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[14-thm-open-topos-slice|thm-244 — 开子拓扑斯等价于子终对象切片]]"},{"id":"af8af33cef1d96d9","anchor":"ref-106","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[14-thm-open-topos-slice]]"},{"id":"4741fef73eb1a614","anchor":"ref-263","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[14-thm-open-topos-slice]]"},{"id":"74d933333cdc3eff","anchor":"ref-13","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"这给出原书的开子 locale $U\\hookrightarrow X$ 和对应闭子 locale $X-U\\hookrightarrow X$ 的具体 frame，而[[14-df-open-closed-topologies]]、[[14-thm-open-closed-closure]]、[[14-thm-open-sheaf-exponential]]、[[14-thm-closed-sheaf-fiber]]、[[14-thm-open-topos-slice]]、[[14-thm-open-closed-complements]]研究的是初等拓扑斯中的 LT 拓扑、层对象与开闭子拓扑斯，类型和新增构造不同。"},{"id":"a4004ce206bd12ec","anchor":"ref-55","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[14-thm-open-topos-slice]]"},{"id":"ffda0c0482667c45","anchor":"ref-185","locations":["正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"[[14-thm-open-topos-slice]]"},{"id":"c60ad289d123497b","anchor":"ref-191","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[14-thm-open-topos-slice|thm-244 — 开子拓扑斯等价于子终对象切片]]"}],"outgoing":["46d4e2094b01f6d4","9b47287c9839ebc7","389620cd4ca5e1c6","7cd6386b14d5d667","4bf0b109a78ca196","c502117a84587a7c"]}